OL,3,AASOS app users receive notifications
OL,4,Afrom hackers in apparent breach
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsos users across the UK have been sent
OL,7,Fpop-up messages from its app that
OL,8,Fappear to have been sent by hackers
OL,9,Ftrying to extort the company.
OL,11,FDozens of people have told the BBC
OL,12,Fabout receiving a strange message from
OL,13,Fthe clothing and beauty store's app,
OL,14,Fappearing on their phone screens.
OL,16,F"Dear ASOS DPO and IT, we have fully
OL,17,Fcompromised the Snowflake instance.
OL,18,FEngage with us, or we will leak it,"
OL,19,Fthe message reads.
OL,21,FAsos did not immediately respond to the
OL,22,FBBC's requests for comment.
OL,23,APub: 06-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
